// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Scholarship Database — a curated reference library of real, well-established
// U.S. scholarship programs a pre-health high schooler is likely to actually
// qualify for, searchable from the Financial Aid tab.
//
// Honesty note (read before adding entries): amounts and deadlines below are
// deliberately given as *typical ranges/seasons*, not exact dollar figures or
// dates — those genuinely change year to year, and stating a specific number
// with false confidence is worse than not stating one. Every entry should be
// treated as a starting point for research, not a submission-ready fact sheet.
// This is reinforced in the UI (ScholarshipDatabase.jsx renders a persistent
// "confirm on the official site" notice) — don't remove that banner without
// keeping an equivalent warning elsewhere.
//
// This is a curated ~90-program reference set, not an exhaustive index of
// "every scholarship that exists" — no database, ours or a paid one, actually
// achieves that, and claiming otherwise would be dishonest. Students can add
// any scholarship not listed here as a custom entry (see FinancialAidPanel),
// including ones local to their school/city/state that no national list
// could ever cover.
